{"seq":3,"slug":"webhook-testing-simulation","title":"Webhook 测试与模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/webhook-testing-simulation","wordCount":1227,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"webhook-测试与模拟\">Webhook 测试与模拟</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Webhook 集成的测试难度来自通信方向反转——不是你调别人，而是别人在不确定时间调你。本文覆盖测试金字塔适配、本地开发隧道工具（ngrok/Cloudflare Tunnel）、请求检查与调试、测试事件构造、契约测试防御 schema 漂移、集成测试策略、以及生产环境的持续验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试-webhook-的独特挑战\">测试 Webhook 的独特挑战</h2><p>Webhook 集成的测试比普通 API 测试更难，原因在于通信方向的反转：不是你调别人，而是别人在不确定的时间调你。这带来三个特殊困难：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>触发不可控</strong>——开发环境中难以按需触发真实 webhook 事件</li>\n<li><strong>网络可达性</strong>——本地开发机器不对公网暴露，provider 无法投递</li>\n<li><strong>非确定性</strong>——事件到达时间、顺序、重复都不确定</li>\n</ol>\n<p>测试策略必须覆盖从单元测试到生产验证的完整链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试金字塔适配\">测试金字塔适配</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    A[单元测试: 签名验证/去重逻辑/业务处理] --&gt; B[集成测试: 接收器 + 队列 + Worker]&#10;    B --&gt; C[契约测试: Provider Schema 兼容性]&#10;    C --&gt; D[端到端测试: 真实 Provider + 隧道]&#10;    D --&gt; E[生产验证: 健康检查 + 合成事件]\">graph BT\n    A[单元测试: 签名验证/去重逻辑/业务处理] --&gt; B[集成测试: 接收器 + 队列 + Worker]\n    B --&gt; C[契约测试: Provider Schema 兼容性]\n    C --&gt; D[端到端测试: 真实 Provider + 隧道]\n    D --&gt; E[生产验证: 健康检查 + 合成事件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>测试什么</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>反馈速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元</td>\n<td>签名验证逻辑、去重逻辑、事件路由</td>\n<td>Jest/pytest + mock</td>\n<td>毫秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成</td>\n<td>接收器 → 队列 → Worker 全链路</td>\n<td>Docker Compose + 本地队列</td>\n<td>秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>契约</td>\n<td>Provider payload schema 兼容性</td>\n<td>JSON Schema 校验</td>\n<td>秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E</td>\n<td>真实 provider 投递到本地端点</td>\n<td>ngrok/Cloudflare Tunnel</td>\n<td>分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产</td>\n<td>上线后持续验证投递健康</td>\n<td>合成事件 + 监控</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本地开发隧道\">本地开发隧道</h2><p>开发者需要将本地服务暴露给 provider 以接收真实 webhook。主流隧道工具对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ngrok</td>\n<td>最成熟，内置检查器 UI</td>\n<td>通用开发测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare Tunnel</td>\n<td>免费，与 CF 生态集成</td>\n<td>长期开发隧道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tailscale Funnel</td>\n<td>基于 WireGuard，安全性高</td>\n<td>团队协作环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>smee.io</td>\n<td>开源，GitHub 官方推荐</td>\n<td>GitHub webhook 开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ngrok 的 webhook 验证功能（2025+）能自动检测主流 provider 的签名格式并验证签名正确性——在事件到达你的代码之前就能发现签名配置错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隧道使用模式\">隧道使用模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启动本地服务&#10;$ node server.js --port 3000&#10;&#10;# 建立隧道&#10;$ ngrok http 3000&#10;# Forwarding: https://abc123.ngrok.io -&gt; http://localhost:3000&#10;&#10;# 在 Provider 控制台注册 webhook URL&#10;# URL: https://abc123.ngrok.io/webhooks/stripe\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启动本地服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> server.js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 建立隧道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ngrok</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Forwarding: https://abc123.ngrok.io -> http://localhost:3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 Provider 控制台注册 webhook URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># URL: https://abc123.ngrok.io/webhooks/stripe</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"请求检查与调试工具\">请求检查与调试工具</h2><p>在开发阶段需要精确观察 provider 发送的请求内容：</p>\n<p><strong>Webhook.site / RequestBin</strong>——提供一个临时 URL，可视化展示收到的所有请求（headers、body、timing）。适合快速验证 provider 配置是否正确。</p>\n<p><strong>ngrok Inspect UI</strong>（<code>http://localhost:4040</code>）——记录所有经过隧道的请求，支持重放（replay），无需重新触发 provider 事件即可反复调试处理逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>Svix CLI <code>listen</code></strong>——专为 Svix 平台设计的本地监听工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"$ svix listen --token $SVIX_TOKEN http://localhost:3000/webhooks&#10;# 实时转发 Svix 平台的 webhook 到本地\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> svix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> listen</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $SVIX_TOKEN </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://localhost:3000/webhooks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时转发 Svix 平台的 webhook 到本地</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构造测试事件\">构造测试事件</h2><p>生产 webhook 的 payload 通常包含复杂的嵌套结构和关联数据。测试需要可靠的 fixture 生成策略：</p>\n<h3 id=\"provider-测试模式\">Provider 测试模式</h3><p>大多数主流 provider 提供测试触发机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Provider</th>\n<th>测试方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Stripe</td>\n<td><code>stripe trigger invoice.paid</code>（CLI 触发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>Settings → Webhooks → Redeliver</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>手动操作测试商店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Svix</td>\n<td>Dashboard → Send Test Event</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"本地-mock-发送器\">本地 Mock 发送器</h3><p>当 provider 不提供便捷的测试触发时，构建本地 mock sender：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { createHmac } from &#39;node:crypto&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function sendTestWebhook(url, secret, payload) {&#10;  const body = JSON.stringify(payload);&#10;  const msgId = `msg_test_${Date.now()}`;&#10;  const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();&#10;  const toSign = `${msgId}.${timestamp}.${body}`;&#10;  const signature = &#39;v1,&#39; + createHmac(&#39;sha256&#39;, secret).update(toSign).digest(&#39;base64&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const response = await fetch(url, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    headers: {&#10;      &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;      &#39;webhook-id&#39;: msgId,&#10;      &#39;webhook-timestamp&#39;: timestamp,&#10;      &#39;webhook-signature&#39;: signature,&#10;    },&#10;    body,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return { status: response.status, body: await response.text() };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createHmac } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:crypto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendTestWebhook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">secret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> msgId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `msg_test_${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> toSign</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msgId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">body</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> signature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'v1,'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createHmac</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, secret).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toSign).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'base64'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'webhook-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: msgId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'webhook-timestamp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: timestamp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'webhook-signature'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: signature,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: response.status, body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"契约测试\">契约测试</h2><p>Webhook 消费者面临的隐蔽风险是 provider 悄悄变更了 payload 结构（新增字段、类型变化、字段重命名）。契约测试通过持续校验 provider schema 的兼容性来防御这类问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Provider Schema Registry] --&gt; B[获取最新 Schema]&#10;    B --&gt; C[对比本地期望 Schema]&#10;    C --&gt; D{兼容?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[测试通过]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[告警: Breaking Change 检测]&#10;    F --&gt; G[通知开发者升级处理逻辑]\">graph LR\n    A[Provider Schema Registry] --&gt; B[获取最新 Schema]\n    B --&gt; C[对比本地期望 Schema]\n    C --&gt; D{兼容?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[测试通过]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[告警: Breaking Change 检测]\n    F --&gt; G[通知开发者升级处理逻辑]</pre><p>实现方式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 CI 中定期拉取 provider 的 OpenAPI/AsyncAPI 文档</li>\n<li>提取 webhook payload 的 JSON Schema</li>\n<li>运行 schema 兼容性检查（如 json-schema-diff）</li>\n<li>Breaking change 时标记为 CI 失败</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试策略\">集成测试策略</h2><p>完整的集成测试应覆盖接收器 → 队列 → Worker 的全链路：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"describe(&#39;Webhook Integration&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;processes invoice.paid end-to-end&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    // 1. 发送签名正确的测试 webhook&#10;    const res = await sendTestWebhook(&#39;http://localhost:3000/webhooks&#39;, TEST_SECRET, {&#10;      type: &#39;invoice.paid&#39;,&#10;      data: { id: &#39;inv_test&#39;, amount: 100 },&#10;    });&#10;    expect(res.status).toBe(200);&#10;&#10;    // 2. 验证事件入队&#10;    await waitFor(() =&gt; expect(queue.depth()).toBeGreaterThan(0));&#10;&#10;    // 3. 触发 worker 处理&#10;    await worker.processNext();&#10;&#10;    // 4. 验证业务结果&#10;    const invoice = await db.invoices.findById(&#39;inv_test&#39;);&#10;    expect(invoice.status).toBe(&#39;paid&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;rejects invalid signature&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const res = await sendTestWebhook(&#39;http://localhost:3000/webhooks&#39;, &#39;wrong_secret&#39;, {&#10;      type: &#39;invoice.paid&#39;,&#10;      data: { id: &#39;inv_test&#39; },&#10;    });&#10;    expect(res.status).toBe(401);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;handles duplicate delivery idempotently&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const payload = { type: &#39;invoice.paid&#39;, data: { id: &#39;inv_dup&#39; } };&#10;    await sendTestWebhook(URL, SECRET, payload);&#10;    await sendTestWebhook(URL, SECRET, payload); // 重复&#10;&#10;    await worker.processAll();&#10;    // 业务操作只执行一次&#10;    expect(await countProcessed(&#39;inv_dup&#39;)).toBe(1);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Webhook Integration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processes invoice.paid end-to-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#242